---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
import Button from './Button.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 border-t border-white/[0.08] bg-black relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <SectionHeader
          eyebrow="Independent Creator"
          title="About LUC4N3X"
          subtitle="An independent developer building software with an uncompromising focus on user experience, performance, privacy, and open source."
        />

        <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <p>
            Hey, I'm Luca. I take rough ideas and turn them into software I can actually use day in and day out.
          </p>
          <p>
            Most days are spent between Android applications, high-throughput backend services, media pipelines, and infrastructure. What matters most is the phase after something starts working: identifying what feels off, fixing the strange edge cases, and refining until the user interaction feels seamless.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-b border-white/[0.08] py-5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#2997ff] mt-0.5">·</span>
            <span>Primarily working with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Python, Linux, and Docker</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#2997ff] mt-0.5">·</span>
            <span>Focused on bugs that only trigger on specific hardware, network paths, or state transitions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#2997ff] mt-0.5">·</span>
            <span>A focused, verified fix is always preferred over an unvetted architectural rewrite</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <Button href="/about" variant="secondary" size="md">
            <span>Read Full Story & Principles</span>
            <span class="ml-1">→</span>
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-5">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0c0c0e] p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-5">
          <div class="relative w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#2997ff]/40 shadow-lg shadow-[#2997ff]/10 flex-shrink-0">
            <img 
              src="/assets/brand/luc4n3x-avatar.png" 
              alt="Luca Drogo (LUC4N3X)" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="112"
              height="112"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col text-center sm:text-left">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2997ff] font-semibold block mb-1">
              Luca Drogo
            </span>
            <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-1">
              Independent Craftsman
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-400">
              Android Internals, Audio Pipelines & Systems
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0c0c0e] p-6">
          <img 
            src="/assets/brand/luc4n3x-workspace.svg" 
            alt="Luca at his developer workspace" 
            class="w-full h-auto object-contain mb-4"
            loading="lazy"
            width="360"
            height="360"
          />
          <div class="text-center text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">
            Developer Workspace · Linux Environment
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
